---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import company from '../data/company.json';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us | Iconic Travel & Tours (GL #5247) — Creating Journeys That Matter"
  description="Learn about Iconic Travel & Tours (GL #5247) in Karachi, Pakistan. Our philosophy, mission, and unwavering commitment to delivering peaceful, organized Umrah journeys."
>

  <!-- Editorial Hero Banner -->
  <section class="relative py-24 bg-brand-emerald text-white overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img
        src="/iconic-travel-tours/images/makkah-panoramic.jpg"
        alt="Masjid al-Haram panorama"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-25 scale-105"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-emerald/90 via-brand-emerald/95 to-brand-forest"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center space-y-6">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-brand-gold">
        <span>About Iconic Travel & Tours</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>Govt License GL #5247</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight text-brand-ivory leading-tight">
        CREATING JOURNEYS THAT MATTER.
      </h1>

      <p class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-base sm:text-lg text-brand-ivory/85 leading-relaxed font-light">
        A sanctuary of trust and guidance for pilgrims traveling from Pakistan to the sacred lands of Makkah al-Mukarramah and Al-Madinah al-Munawwarah.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section: Company Overview & Philosophy -->
  <section class="py-24 bg-brand-ivory">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
        
        <div class="lg:col-span-6 relative">
          <div class="rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-luxury-lg border border-brand-gold/30">
            <img
              src="/iconic-travel-tours/images/madinah-courtyard.jpg"
              alt="Pilgrims at the Prophet's Mosque courtyard"
              class="w-full h-[500px] object-cover"
            />
          </div>
          <!-- Inset detail badge -->
          <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -right-6 bg-brand-forest text-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-brand-gold/30 shadow-luxury hidden sm:block max-w-xs">
            <p class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-brand-gold">Your Comfort, Our Priority</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-brand-ivory/80 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
              Every package is verified to guarantee direct courtyard proximity and dedicated on-ground liaison.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6">
          <span class="text-xs uppercase font-mono tracking-[0.25em] text-brand-gold-dark font-semibold">
            Our Heritage & Philosophy
          </span>

          <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-brand-emerald leading-snug">
            Stewardship in Every Mile of Your Faith
          </h2>

          <p class="text-base text-brand-charcoal-light leading-relaxed">
            Iconic Travel & Tours operates under Government License <strong>GL #5247</strong> from our registered premises at Office #502, Iconic Business Center, Sharfabad, Karachi. We view pilgrimage not as commercial travel, but as a sacred trust (Amanah).
          </p>

          <p class="text-sm text-brand-charcoal-muted leading-relaxed">
            When a traveler steps into Ihram, their emotional state should be attuned to worship, repentance, and peace. However, logistical unpredictability—distant hotel arrangements, confusing bus assembly points, or unassisted airport queues—often drains that sacred focus. Iconic Travel & Tours was founded to eliminate those anxieties through structured management, luxury partnerships, and 24/7 bilingual on-ground support.
          </p>

          <!-- Verified Accreditation Summary -->
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-brand-gold/20 space-y-3">
            <h4 class="font-serif text-base font-semibold text-brand-emerald">Official Credentials & Registrations:</h4>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs text-brand-charcoal">
              <div class="p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-gold/15">
                <span class="font-semibold block text-brand-emerald">DTS License:</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-brand-gold-dark font-bold">GL #5247</span>
              </div>
              <div class="p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-gold/15">
                <span class="font-semibold block text-brand-emerald">Corporate Address:</span>
                <span class="text-brand-charcoal-muted">Iconic Business Center, Karachi</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section: Mission, Vision, and Commitment -->
  <section class="py-24 bg-brand-forest text-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 space-y-4">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase font-mono tracking-[0.25em] text-brand-gold font-semibold">
          Guiding Pillars
        </span>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-white">
          Our Mission, Vision & Commitment
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        
        <!-- Mission -->
        <div class="bg-brand-emerald/60 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-brand-gold/20 shadow-luxury space-y-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-brand-gold/20 text-brand-gold flex items-center justify-center font-serif text-xl font-bold">
            01
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-white">Our Mission</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-ivory/80 leading-relaxed">
            To provide seamless, dignified, and religiously authentic travel services that empower pilgrims to fulfill their spiritual obligations with complete ease, peace of mind, and physical comfort.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Vision -->
        <div class="bg-brand-emerald/60 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-brand-gold/20 shadow-luxury space-y-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-brand-gold/20 text-brand-gold flex items-center justify-center font-serif text-xl font-bold">
            02
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-white">Our Vision</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-ivory/80 leading-relaxed">
            To be recognized across Pakistan and internationally as the gold standard in premium pilgrimage travel, distinguished by honest representations, unyielding integrity, and high-hospitality standards.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Commitment -->
        <div class="bg-brand-emerald/60 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-brand-gold/20 shadow-luxury space-y-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-brand-gold/20 text-brand-gold flex items-center justify-center font-serif text-xl font-bold">
            03
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-white">Our Commitment</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-ivory/80 leading-relaxed">
            We pledge never to overpromise or conceal terms. Every hotel distance, transportation standard, and breakfast arrangement published is verified with on-site accountability.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section: Group Travel Support & The Customer-First Approach -->
  <section class="py-24 bg-brand-ivory">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <span class="text-xs uppercase font-mono tracking-[0.25em] text-brand-gold-dark font-semibold">
            Group Coordination Excellence
          </span>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-brand-emerald leading-tight">
            Specialized Care for Community & Corporate Groups
          </h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-charcoal-light leading-relaxed">
            Organizing group pilgrimages requires rare operational discipline. As demonstrated by our featured <strong>TECNO Umrah Group Tour 2026 / 1448 AH</strong>, Iconic Travel & Tours deploys dedicated coordinators who travel with the group, oversee luggage movement, pre-allocate room keys, and lead daily Ziyarat circuits in chartered coaches.
          </p>
          <div class="space-y-3 text-xs text-brand-charcoal">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-gold/20">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-gold"></span>
              <span><strong>Pre-Flight Orientation:</strong> Complete briefing in Karachi prior to departure.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-gold/20">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-gold"></span>
              <span><strong>Coordinated Dining:</strong> Dedicated morning breakfast schedules (06:30 AM – 10:00 AM).</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-gold/20">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-gold"></span>
              <span><strong>Multilingual Officers:</strong> Urdu, English, and Arabic speaking ground staff.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative">
          <div class="rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-luxury border border-brand-gold/30">
            <img
              src="/iconic-travel-tours/images/luxury-hotel-dining.jpg"
              alt="Pilgrim group dining hall setup"
              class="w-full h-[400px] object-cover"
            />
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section: CTA Banner -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-brand-emerald text-white text-center">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-6">
      <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-white">
        Begin Planning Your Umrah with Confidence
      </h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-brand-ivory/80 max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Contact our Karachi headquarters or request a tailored proposal for your family or group.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4 pt-2">
        <a
          href="/iconic-travel-tours/request-a-quote/"
          class="px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase bg-brand-gold text-brand-emerald hover:brightness-110 shadow-md transition-all"
        >
          Request Custom Proposal
        </a>
        <a
          href="/iconic-travel-tours/contact/"
          class="px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white border border-brand-gold/40 transition-all"
        >
          Contact Our Karachi Office
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
